ed about their  relationship i don't know if you are  aware of how good the internet thinks  you look it's like all everyone's  talking about lately i think you might  be no i'm not  i'm really not ben um i is it the jlo  glow like how much happiness is she  bringing into your life because you're  looking good man is it the corduroy is  that when she was big on the quarter  because i wasn't sure about court they  told me it's fall  a month later jen was by ben's side to  support him at the premiere of his flick  the tender bar where ben opened up to  e.t about the intensity of life in the  spotlight  in my life um  i've been through a lot of different  kinds of experiences with the press and  it's just a it's like a function of what  you do right it's not my favorite part  of the job it's not what i would choose  to do but it is a responsibility in mind  i take seriously and  you have to promote this work and things  seem to be better than ever for the  lovebirds in fact a source recently told  e.t jen helps bring out the best in the  49 year old oscar winner quote he loves  jennifer and says she makes him a better  person and motivates him to work hard he  wants to take care of her even though  she doesn't need him to that is just the  type of guy he is  [Music]
 

